how the cause of basement water and your backup endorsement limit change what a claim can pay.</span><span class="card-more">Open tool <svg class="ar" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-tint"><div class="wrap faq-wrap"><div class="faq-l reveal"><p class="kicker">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the workbench together</h2><ol class="ordered"><li>Start with the <a href="/appraisal-workbench/claim-calendar-builder/">claim calendar builder</a> so no date slips past.</li><li>Check the roof with the <a href="/appraisal-workbench/roof-area-pitch-calculator/">roof area &amp; pitch calculator</a>.</li><li>See what you’re owed with the <a href="/appraisal-workbench/percentage-deductible-calculator/">percentage deductible</a> and <a href="/appraisal-workbench/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">RCV/ACV holdback</a> calculators — or the <a href="/appraisal-workbench/basement-backup-sublimit-calculator/">backup sublimit calculator</a> for basement water.</li><li>Test the dispute with the <a href="/appraisal-workbench/claim-gap-fee-estimator/">claim gap &amp; fee estimator</a>.</li><li>Finish with the <a href="/appraisal-workbench/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">readiness checkup</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="reveal"><div class="side-box side-call"><h2 class="side-h">Talk it through first</h2><p>The first conversation is free. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="side-tel" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-white" href="/contact-our-team/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
